WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.514
Step 1. Open the dispense order.

1.2
00:00:02.514 --> 00:00:06.194
Here you pause a dispense order and resume it later.

1.3
00:00:06.194 --> 00:00:12.496
After you bill the medicines, Care opens the order on the Dispense Medicines page.

2.1
00:00:12.496 --> 00:00:18.647
Step 2. Put the order on hold. Select Put on hold, then confirm with Put on hold.

2.2
00:00:18.647 --> 00:00:23.664
Care sets the order to Draft and opens the Prescription Queue.

3.1
00:00:23.664 --> 00:00:26.045
Step 3. Open the order again.

3.2
00:00:26.045 --> 00:00:30.675
The order waits on the Pending tab of the Dispense Orders page.

3.3
00:00:30.675 --> 00:00:34.865
In the location sidebar, under Pharmacy, select Dispense,

3.4
00:00:34.865 --> 00:00:38.011
then select View Order on the order.

4.1
00:00:38.011 --> 00:00:42.278
Step 4. Resume the order. Select Put in Preparation.

4.2
00:00:42.278 --> 00:00:47.994
Care sets the order, and each dispense that is not completed or cancelled,

4.3
00:00:47.994 --> 00:00:49.653
to In Progress.
